      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Journeys that changed their minds",
      "content": "Elise is writing a fictional essay collection about plans that changed without becoming catastrophes. Several short pieces are drafted; the chapter about choosing not to leave home is unfinished. She is trying to observe without turning every inconvenience into a moral lesson. A partner can read a newly written excerpt or ignore the project. There is no implied real publication or secret writing between chats.",
